  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SP - Biofuel value chain in Kenya - NIBIO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop a valuechain for biofuel production in Kenya. A Strategic Partnership project with NIBIO as agreement partner and NIBIO, Norges Vel and six Kenyan partners as implementing partners to develop a valuechain for biofuel production and sale on a commercial basis in Kenya over a three year period, to replace charcoal for cooking and use biomasse from the local sugar industry in the biofuel production.</narrative>
  </description>
